veloper/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068646/state.json" "file_sha256" "70d8e6e9a8536ec73d6f1f7a902f0885c5e0495e1d412bdbe360fe1fcc84a4e4"} {"question" "q-332932" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's sketch the trajectory.\n\n- We start at the given point, going along with the flow (upward and slightly to the right) until the trajectory intersects the $x$-nullcline, where the tangents are vertical.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068646/assets/6d897c2e9249447cc2d0c902a592d04442b0928c315163b6ab80cff288c84657.png)\n\n- Next, the flow continues going upward but then starts turning  to the left.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068646/assets/bed6896ecc0edcdb157b648108d403e1b8e29463d9f61aa0e0c26e8f5e2dd8c6.png)\n\n- After that, the trajectory continues upward and slightly to the left, suggesting that it may converge to the origin\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068646/assets/cc53577a278595e5f0155119aa5eb1a7b27ec01847a6daa1ba6ade6792c5f5e9.png)" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068646/state.json" "file_sha256" "70d8e6e9a8536ec73d6f1f7a902f0885c5e0495e1d412bdbe360fe1fcc84a4e4"} {"question" "q-332932" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068646/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "3952ac3e72d16baf204352e641b94778a63aa5cf917e6243634d622c4b644385"} {"question" "q-332932" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/r